{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","神锋裂地"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","地割りの神槍"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","挥舞长枪朝一个方向持续行军。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","槍術を繰り出しながら、一つの方向へ持続的に移動"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向，以华丽无双的枪法向该方向行军3格。在此过程中，珀尔修斯会对周围1格范围内的敌人造成11次85% + 10% ATK伤害，并且持续将敌人向自身行进方向击退。行军完毕后，珀尔修斯会释放一次盾牌猛击，对周围1格内的所有敌人造成280% + 30% ATK伤害和2秒眩晕。珀尔修斯在本技能释放期间霸体。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","方向を選択し、華麗な槍術を繰り出しながらその方向へ3マス移動。移動中、自身の周囲1マス以内の敵に85% + 10% ATKのダメージを11回与え、敵を持続的に自身の進行方向へ後退させる。移動終了後、盾による強烈な一撃で周囲1マス以内の敵全体に280% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、2秒間のスタンを付与。このスキルの発動中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":60,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":121,"end":127,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":125,"end":131,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":117,"end":131,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":151,"end":153,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":121,"end":135,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":168,"end":176,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","行军期间伤害提升至90% + 10% ATK，盾牌猛击伤害提升至290% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","移動中のダメージが90% + 10% ATKにUPし、盾の攻撃のダメージが290% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"st